## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.7 Code
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI’s coding-specialized 1T/32B MoE model (K2.7 family cut) for long-horizon coding and terminal workflows.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights on Hugging Face (`moonshotai/Kimi-K2.7-Code`, license as stated on HF) and Kimi Code/platform APIs. Local metadata lists `opencode/kimi-k2.7-code` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Hugging Face model card reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `Kimi-K2.7-Code`, `moonshotai/Kimi-K2.7-Code`.
- **Context window:** 262,144 tokens (256K, local metadata/HF context).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (per local metadata; coding-specialized usage).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Hosted pricing varies (local metadata cites $0.95/$4.00 per 1M in/out, $0.19 cached input). Open/self-host options depend on HF release/license.
- **Architecture:** Sparse MoE, 1T total parameters / 32B active parameters (local metadata/family context).

